  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Frame Naturskydds 2008</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frame SNF 2008 - Fram SNF 2008</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A one year bridging agreement with Swedish Society for Nature Conservation amounting to 28 000 000 during 2008, in order for Sida to undertake an in-depth assessment of SSNC&apos;s three year proposal. During 2008, an external framework assessment and a follow-up of the system revision was also undertaken. 3000000 was for Eastern Europe and the rest of the programme is found under 7400335601</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett-&#xE5;rig f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;gning av Naturskyddsf&#xF6;reningens 3 &#xE5;rs Ramavtal, f&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; tid att dels g&#xF6;ra en resultat analys, samt utv&#xE4;rdering av verksamheten samt en beredning f&#xF6;r en ett nytt tre&#xE5;rsavtal. Av programmets totala 28 000 000 var 3000 0000 avsatta f&#xF6;r verksamhet i &#xD6;st Europa och finns under 7400335601</narrative>
  </description>
